#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:4
msgid "v4.0.1"
msgstr "v4.0.1"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.0.1 adds a basic GC2145 camera driver, makes the OV7670 clock "
"configurable, and fixes the OV767x driver, :class:`pyb.Servo` timer, AMG8833"
" init, and H7 USB ULPI low-power mode. It introduces **no breaking API "
"changes** — v4.0.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v4.0.1 dodaje osnovni upravljački program za kameru GC2145, čini takt OV7670"
" podesivim te ispravlja OV767x upravljački program, :class:`pyb.Servo` "
"mjerač vremena, AMG8833 inicijalizaciju i H7 USB ULPI način niske potrošnje."
" Ne uvodi **nikakve promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost** — "
"skripte za v4.0.0 rade nepromijenjene."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Istaknuto"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:19
msgid "**GC2145** camera sensor — basic driver added."
msgstr "**GC2145** senzor kamere — dodan osnovni upravljački program."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:20
msgid "**OV7670** clock (CLKRC) is now configurable."
msgstr "**OV7670** takt (CLKRC) sada je podesiv."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:21
msgid ""
"Fixes for the OV767x driver, :class:`pyb.Servo` timer, AMG8833, and H7 USB "
"ULPI low-power mode."
msgstr ""
"Ispravci za OV767x upravljački program, :class:`pyb.Servo` mjerač vremena, "
"AMG8833 i H7 USB ULPI način niske potrošnje."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:23
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v4.0.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Nikakve promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost** — ponovno "
"isprogramirajte i vaše skripte za v4.0.0 rade nepromijenjene."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:27
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:29
msgid "**GC2145** — added a basic GC2145 camera sensor driver."
msgstr "**GC2145** — dodan osnovni upravljački program senzora kamere GC2145."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:30
msgid "**OV7670** — the OV7670 clock rate (CLKRC) is now configurable."
msgstr "**OV7670** — brzina takta OV7670 (CLKRC) sada je podesiva."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:33
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Ostale promjene i poboljšanja"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:35
msgid ""
"The LWIP networking stack was reverted to a stable release for more reliable"
" WiFi/Ethernet; the Arduino Portenta H7 SPI2 bus was enabled."
msgstr ""
"LWIP mrežni stog vraćen je na stabilno izdanje radi pouzdanijeg "
"WiFi/Ethernet rada; omogućena je SPI2 sabirnica na Arduino Portenta H7."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:39
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci pogrešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:41
msgid ""
"Fixed the OV767x camera driver, the :class:`pyb.Servo` timer, AMG8833 "
"thermal sensor initialization, STM32 H7 USB ULPI low-power mode, and "
"Ethernet low-power-mode init."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljen OV767x upravljački program kamere, :class:`pyb.Servo` mjerač "
"vremena, inicijalizacija AMG8833 toplinskog senzora, STM32 H7 USB ULPI način"
" niske potrošnje i inicijalizacija Ethernet načina niske potrošnje."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:46
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hardver i podrška za ploče"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:48
msgid "**GC2145** camera sensor (basic support)."
msgstr "**GC2145** senzor kamere (osnovna podrška)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:49
msgid "**Arduino Portenta H7** — SPI2 bus enabled."
msgstr "**Arduino Portenta H7** — omogućena SPI2 sabirnica."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:52
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.0.1.rst:54
msgid ""
"v4.0.1 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v4.0.0 run unchanged on v4.0.1 — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v4.0.1 ne uvodi **nikakve promjene Python API-ja koje narušavaju "
"kompatibilnost**\\ . Skripte koje su radile na v4.0.0 rade nepromijenjene na"
" v4.0.1 — samo ponovno isprogramirajte ugrađeni program (firmware)."
